      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "POINT BREAK (7) was prominent throughout when winning two back but could manage only midfield last time when 4th and beaten 4.5 lengths at Sandown (29.89). Can atone. FLASH OF GENIUS (8) scored (29.75) last time out at Sandown adding to an already respectable career. Form at the trip sound including 12 wins. Strong form has emerged from his last run. Makes plenty of appeal if runs up to latest. TARBHACH (5) lines up here off a comfortable win at this track after jumping from box 4 (25.86). Has a tricky draw to overcome and will need a clean break. Leading chance again. I'M FABULOUS (1) hit the frame latest (22.55) when second at this track in a Free For All. Has six wins already from this draw.",
